Fri Oct 23 06:56:01 UTC 2026 - Paolo Stivanin <info@paolostivanin.com>

- Update to 0.14.0 (upstream tag v0.14.0, 2026-10-23):
  * 0.12.0: DDS save (uncompressed or BC1-BC3, optional mipmaps);
    indexed GIFs open in Indexed Color; PSD saves Indexed, Bitmap
    and Duotone in their own mode; History panel menu and History
    Brush source; Smart Filters map 41 filters to PSD (was 14);
    graphics adapter choice on multi-GPU Linux; faster many-layer
    GPU composites and Blur/Sharpen strokes; crop, actions, type
    and PSB save fixes.
  * 0.13.0: GIMP XCF import (layers, groups, masks, channels,
    selection); DICOM and Amiga IFF/ILBM read, Cineon save, .act
    colour tables; HEIF honours nclx, HLG/PQ HEICs open as linear
    BT.2020 32-bit; JPEG Options dialog, Export As resample and
    file size, Layers panel thumbnail sizes, Object Finder, user
    contour library; recovery after a lost GPU device; Hindi
    catalog, French, Turkish, Czech, Russian and pt-BR updates;
    photocraft-cli convert refuses to overwrite its input unless
    --in-place; many tool, .atn and PSD compatibility fixes.
  * 0.14.0: tighter automation workspace checks for export, linked
    files and dialogs; View > Extras hides the Move tool's
    transform controls; strided row sampling overflow fix.
  * Security hardening (no CVE ids): bounded RAW, XCF, PDN, HEIF,
    deep-EXR, TIFF, PCX/XPM, SVG and pattern decode work and
    allocations, linear-time lookups replacing quadratic scans,
    bounded nested automation playback, IPP printer names encoded,
    hardened temporary and recovery files, gzip SVG no longer
    decompressed twice.
  * Re-vendored (update=false, lockfile respected): the only new
    vendored crates are roxmltree 0.21.1 (MIT OR Apache-2.0) and
    yeslogic-fontconfig-sys 6.0.1 (MIT), optional fontique deps of
    its system feature, which upstream enables on macOS only, so
    neither is built here; the shipped targets' crate set is
    otherwise unchanged; license re-derived over the shipped
    targets, no new copyleft, tag stands; no new system deps; the
    cargo_vendor lockfile audit reports no advisories.
- Set the fixed metainfo release date to 2026-10-23 (v0.14.0); it
  was still the v0.10.0 date.

