Sun Oct 18 17:32:30 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.10.0 (upstream tag v0.10.0, 2026-10-18):
  * Tools: per-control pressure curves, image files as brush tips,
    Pen Shift 45-degree constraints, arrow-key nudges in one History
    state; Pen/brush sampling and Free Transform fixes.
  * File handling: .atn duplicate-into-new-document, SVG text
    transforms kept, Targa RLE scanline fix, PSD warp-clamp and
    non-finite sanitization, flat fallback with decode budget.
  * Performance: Stack Mode 8-17x faster, Photomerge 4x faster,
    lower-stack cache follows edits; GPU pattern textures freed on
    close and over budget.
  * Hardening (no CVE ids): transactional channel pastes, bounded
    selection sampling, ICC checked arithmetic, control-token file
    permission refusal, linked paths restricted to computer/share,
    read-only file replace refused.
  * Print through CUPS over IPP and the print portal; pure-Rust
    photocraft-ipp client, no new system dependency.
    `photocraft --help` prints usage.
  * Security: fixes RUSTSEC-2026-0344 (ruzstd decompression bomb,
    CVSS 7.5) via ruzstd 0.9.1; craft-docpath 0.1.0 added (MIT OR
    Apache-2.0). Re-vendored (update=false, lockfile respected);
    license re-derived over shipped targets, no new copyleft, tag
    stands.

