Tue Oct 13 07:39:05 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.8.2 (upstream tag v0.8.2, 2026-10-12):
  * New tools: Color Replacement, Color Sampler, Artboard, Frame,
    Perspective Crop, Freeform/Curvature Pen, Convert Point and
    Anchor Point tools, Horizontal/Vertical Type Mask.
  * Auto-Align Layers and Auto-Blend Stack Images; FITS read/write;
    File Info shows EXIF/XMP camera data; TGA asks 24 or 32 bits;
    animated GIFs keep transparency; PSD decoding interop fixes.
  * Faster canvas: brush-stroke commit freeze fixed, GPU stack-chunk
    reuse, faster feathered masks, cached Select Subject; Select
    and Mask gains live preview, Refine Edge Brush, new outputs.
  * Security hardening (no CVE ids): bounded exports/automation
    inputs, pattern-size limits, overflow-safe blob/ZIP decode,
    PSD over-budget guard; heic-rs pin moves 0.1.1 to 0.1.4,
    fixing six fuzz-found malformed-file panics.
  * Re-vendored (lockfile respected, update=false kept: update=true
    aborts against --locked in this service); license re-derived
    over the shipped targets, no new copyleft, tag stands; heif
    stays on via the single pure-Rust heic-rs crate, no sysdeps.

