Sun Oct 11 06:59:09 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- New package photocraft 0.6.0 (upstream tag v0.6.0, 2026-10-10),
  built from source with --features heif (pure-Rust heic-rs 0.1.1,
  no system HEIF library).
- License derived over the vendor tree for the shipped targets
  (photocraft, photocraft-cli): no copyleft linked; tag covers the
  embedded OFL-1.1 fonts, ISC icons, CC-BY-3.0 glyph and CC0-1.0
   profile, see the Legal-Review-Notice in the spec.
- BuildRequires hicolor-icon-theme so the filelist checker finds
  /usr/share/icons/hicolor owned in the build root (runtime
  Requires alone does not satisfy it).
- Split out photocraft-cli subpackage (own description and files,
  main package ships the GUI only, main Recommends: photocraft-cli);
  the headless CLI needs none of the X11/Wayland/Vulkan Requires.

